{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，韓國舉行的税務師資格考試中，160道題僅錯1題的「狀元」親口承認了自己用AI智能眼鏡作弊，引發巨大風波。當事人在今年4月舉行的税務師第一次考試中，400分滿分得397.5分。160道題中僅財政學錯1題，税法學概論、會計學概論和商法均獲滿分。在7月舉行的論述型第二次考試中，800分滿分得663分，位居第一名。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586962.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:15:39.794317+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:37:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:08:53.709192+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:08:53.709192+00:00","content_hash":"a4daa6b2278ef954ece3a8c46c3bbbbe09139a3cb4b25913c90f1cda0581a31f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}